  "evidence": "TEXT_F: Over £30bn extra for the NHS, ring-fenced mental-health budgets, £8bn for social care, Ethical Care Charter, free hospital parking; scrap sanctions and Bedroom Tax, raise ESA and Carer’s Allowance; over 1m homes with at least 100k social homes/year, three‑year tenancies and rent caps, end rough sleeping; £10 Living Wage, ban zero‑hours, rights from day one; accept the referendum with a jobs‑first Brexit, 10,000 more police and 500 extra border guards; defence at 2% of GDP and renew Trident; Fiscal Credibility Rule to eliminate day‑to‑day deficit in five years; crack down on tax avoidance.\nTEXT_D: 1p Income Tax rise raising £6bn for NHS/social care, integrate care, mental‑health waiting‑time standards, restore public health funding; uprate benefits, scrap two‑child cap and bedroom tax, raise LHA; 300k homes/year and renters’ reforms, Housing First to end rough sleeping; second referendum with option to remain, protect EU citizens’ rights, welcome 50k Syrian refugees and reopen Dubs; defence at 2% with reduced‑readiness deterrent; eliminate day‑to‑day deficit by 2020 with a dedicated health/care tax and independent budget monitor; legal, regulated cannabis and presumption against short sentences.",
